  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's perception-action cycle, separating sensor outcomes from motion commands. The specification encodes safe, progress-oriented exploration: random_walk is preferred in clear states, move_forward is used for short progress, and obstacle events trigger conservative, directed recovery. Recovery states only allow the appropriate turn, and full_rotate is reserved for rare, persistent blockage. All uncontrollables are handled in every state, and only one controllable is enabled per state to avoid oscillation.",
